WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------
The written and curated content of this repository:

  - The registry data in data/skills.json and the descriptions derived from it
  - README.md and README.zh-CN.md
  - The benchmark corpus, rubric and protocol under benchmark/
  - The principles documents under principles/
  - Research notes under docs/

Code in this repository (scripts/, benchmark/runner/, .github/) is licensed
separately under the MIT License — see LICENSE-CODE.

Projects listed in the registry are NOT covered by this license. Each linked
project carries its own license, and at least one is AGPL-3.0. Check before
commercial use.


