A NOTE ON THE BENCHMARK
-----------------------
Benchmark scores may be reproduced and cited freely. If you do, please carry
the caveats with the numbers: the run count, the model used, and the commit SHA
of the skill under test. A score quoted without its context is worse than no
score, because it looks like a fact.

If you re-run the benchmark and reach a different result, that is a feature.
Publish it.


